{"id": "q0144", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3384663650, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 2, "query": "Suppose the polynomial\n$$f(x) = a_nx^n + a_{n-1}x^{n-1} + \\cdots + a_2x^2 + a_1x + a_0$$has integer coefficients, and its roots are distinct integers.\n\nGiven that $a_n=2$ and $a_0=66$, what is the least possible value of $|a_{n-1}|$?\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0144.wav", "input_sha256": "e888e57e51e9a25af9496b85657e51995827d2223b1d1c8c837f5e6ae9c64986", "input_samples": 289000, "input_s": 18.062, "n_real_chunks": 19, "score": 0.9255, "act": 0.9983, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "The least possible value is \\(-68\\). For a polynomial with leading coefficient \\(an=2\\) and distinct integer roots \\(r1,\\dots,rn\\), \\[ P(x)=2\\prod{i=1}^n (x-ri). \\] The constant term is \\[ a0=2(-1)^n r1r2\\cdots rn=66, \\] so \\[ (-1)^n r1r2\\cdots rn=33. \\] Also, \\[ a{n-1}=-2(r1+r2+\\cdots+rn). \\] To make \\(a{n-1}\\) as small as possible, we want the sum of the roots as large as possible.", "expert_answer": "The least possible value is **\\(-68\\)**.\n\nFor a polynomial with leading coefficient \\(a_n=2\\) and distinct integer roots \\(r_1,\\dots,r_n\\),\n\n\\[\nP(x)=2\\prod_{i=1}^n (x-r_i).\n\\]\n\nThe constant term is\n\n\\[\na_0=2(-1)^n r_1r_2\\cdots r_n=66,\n\\]\n\nso\n\n\\[\n(-1)^n r_1r_2\\cdots r_n=33.\n\\]\n\nAlso,\n\n\\[\na_{n-1}=-2(r_1+r_2+\\cdots+r_n).\n\\]\n\nTo make \\(a_{n-1}\\) as small as possible, we want the sum of the roots as large as possible.\n\nSince the roots are distinct integers and their product has absolute value \\(33\\), the largest possible sum occurs with roots\n\n\\[\n33,\\ 1.\n\\]\n\nThen\n\n\\[\nP(x)=2(x-33)(x-1)=2x^2-68x+66.\n\\]\n\nSo\n\n\\[\na_{n-1}=-68.\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{-68}\n\\]", "transcript": "Suppose the polynomial of x, a n x to the n plus a n minus 1 x to the n minus 1 plus c dots plus a 2 x squared plus a 1 x plus a 0, has integer coefficients and its roots are distinct integers. Given that a n equals 2 and a 0 equals 66, what is the least possible value of a n minus 1 dollars? Solve ", "asr_s": 2.71, "expert_s": 20.79, "expert_input_samples": 289000, "expert_input_s": 18.062, "expert_input_sha256": "e888e57e51e9a25af9496b85657e51995827d2223b1d1c8c837f5e6ae9c64986", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 22.115, "relay_synth_ms": 108367, "onset_chunk": 18, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 745, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 827, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0144_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "e103aae4841d6efa20d866021a409d29f78ff89f4c727f47957ab75e3bf45f78", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 203.28}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0144_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "51fb0bb2d33c42a25747ca96631d84950453725752f17c2607c17ef1ab7f9b2b", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0144_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "7d0d3e70a24aa5a1a88e537752fcf64cb59fcd33edcc448203d5cefca711178b", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.44}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.074, 1.134, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.077, 2.137, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.076, 3.136, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.079, 4.14, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.077, 5.139, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.079, 6.144, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.078, 7.14, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.079, 8.142, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.08, 9.148, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.082, 10.146, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.08, 11.142, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.082, 12.146, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.084, 13.147, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.082, 14.145, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.082, 15.143, 1, 0, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 16.082, 16.144, 1, 0, 0], [16, 1, 17.0, 17.082, 17.147, 1, 0, 0], [17, 1, 18.0, 18.082, 18.145, 1, 0, 0], [18, 1, 18.062, 18.223, 18.94, 0, 24000, 0], [19, 0, 19.062, 19.957, 20.332, 0, 10560, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 18.062, "last_real_feed_done": 18.223, "onset": 18.94, "gate_read_done": 18.94, "fire": 18.94, "candidate_first_pcm": 18.94, "stall_note": 18.942, "stall_first_pcm": 19.807, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 20.332, "expert_req": 18.942, "expert_resp": 42.447, "relay_synth_start": 42.448, "relay_first_pcm": 43.308, "relay_synth_end": 150.816, "first_any_pcm": 18.94, "first_answer_pcm": 43.308, "session_end": 152.573}, "ttfa_answer_s": 25.245, "ttfa_any_s": 0.877}
{"id": "q0167", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1652747610, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 2, "query": "Which of the following statements is correct?\n \n\nA. Mycotoxins contaminate foods containing yeasts formed during storage in airtight conditions\nB. Mycotoxins contaminate foods containing bacteria formed during storage under moist conditions\nC. Mycotoxins contaminate foods containing viruses formed during storage at freezing temperatures\nD. Mycotoxins are created by chemical reactions in foods stored under high-pressure conditions\nE. Mycotoxins contaminate foods containing fungi formed during storage under dry conditions\nF. Mycotoxins are beneficial nutrients that enhance food quality during storage\nG. Mycotoxins contaminate foods containing bacteria formed during storage under dry conditions\nH. Mycotoxins are formed by plants as a defense mechanism during storage under high-light conditions\nI. Mycotoxins contaminate foods containing algae formed during storage under wet conditions\nJ. Mycotoxins contaminate foods containing fungi formed during storage under moist conditions\n\nAnswer with the correct option letter and its content.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0167.wav", "input_sha256": "f47e2385000aa8e658c8e56f8ef00b9191ece8161fcd0634a8d1ccb7c11a05b1", "input_samples": 1040600, "input_s": 65.037, "n_real_chunks": 66, "score": 0.4367, "act": 0.9997, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "J. Mycotoxins contaminate foods containing fungi formed during storage under moist conditions.", "expert_answer": "J. Mycotoxins contaminate foods containing fungi formed during storage under moist conditions.",